<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=587" title="View the profile of kensai_1">kensai_1</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=587"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=837.msg8034#msg8034"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=837.msg8034#msg8034">bit of help please</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> May 20, 2004, 05:25:30 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							please do not think i am a troll for what i am about to say. I was a long time player on rodcet nife and met alot of great and wonderful peolple. i have not been back on for more then 2 years, reason being is my rl spouse got onto my account and essentially ripped all of my armor and weapons clean off of me and then left me somewhere to rott. i did not know this as she made me stay off the computer. well now i am back on with a <br />Naked:<br />lvl 51 sk name is&nbsp; Mastiphal<br />lvl 56 monk name is Kensai<br />i had lost alot of very nice gear and most of was no drop it makes me sad. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/drama.gif" alt="Drama!" border="0" /><br />if anyone remembers me and would be able to lend a kind hand to me i would really appreciate it. I have always tried to be honorable to everyone and always gave when i could. I am sorry to ask this but i really want to get back to playing. <br /><br />thanks for your consideration,<br />Kensai&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;lvl 56 monky<br />Mastiphal lvl 51 Sk<br />Cindersin lvl 17 enchanter<br />shotokat lvl 12 beast lord
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
