								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=837.msg8039#msg8039">Re: bit of help please</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> May 20, 2004, 07:55:49 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							hi killy,<br />yes she dumped all my pp on ea. of the characters. i could farm dalnir and be safe. i guess that could be one option. <br /><br />yes we are still married but she has let the rope out. she actually paid for me to play again.<br /><br />watch out for a women&#039;s scorn that all i can say.<br /><br />the sad thing is i had so many folks help me when kensai finally got his epic and to loose that really hurt. it wasnt just the epic it was all my many friends that had joined in.<br /><br />kensai
						</td>
