								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=837.msg8041#msg8041">Re: bit of help please</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> May 20, 2004, 08:58:17 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think many people loose sight of that aspect of the game anymore.<br /><br />It&#039;s not so much about the loots, it&#039;s about who is with you when you get them. Honor and commitment can be a rare thing anymore.<br /><br />Of course, if it were more common place, some guilds would probably not exsist anymore.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Guiild Leader of <a href="http://www.fotguild.com" target="_blank">Fires of Time</a><br /><br /><span style="font-family: 2;">A little piece of paper with a picture drawn<br />&nbsp;floats on down the street till the wind is gone. <br />The memory now is like the picture was then, <br />When the paper&#039;s crumpled up, it can&#039;t be perfect again. </span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
