	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8065"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=587" title="View the profile of kensai_1">kensai_1</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=587"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=837.msg8065#msg8065"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=837.msg8065#msg8065">Re: bit of help please</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> May 21, 2004, 05:50:04 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							in reply to all, i want to say that i respect all that you say. the reason she is allowing me to get back on is i am getting ready to get 6 vertebrae fused in the middle of my back. she knows this is a great out let for stress for me. that is why she paid for me to play again. in the two years that i stopped playing i have worked hard to treat my wife like the queen she is. we both love each other and i know this is nothing but a fantastic game. <br /><br />what i miss about the game was the bonding we shared for one another. i new 100 good friends and at anytime during then i would stop at a drop of hat and be there to help them. when Kensai got his epic i was not in a guild but just because i had created those bonds and friend those same friends dropped and came over to help. as i sad before its not about hand out. it, my friends that i played for all those years. i have never asked for a hand out ever ever before and while i played i was always more then generous to help out those in needs. I apologize that i asked for help. i will do this on my own. thank you for you posts and all your honesty. i was a great monk and will be again with the help of my fellow caring players.<br /><br />thanks again for all of you input
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
