							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							oh and desert rat i always thought the inc &quot; Boot to the Head&quot; brought smiles to people faces I will try and be more oriniginal in the future. that was my first inc message when i started may of 99 or somewheres about. thanks for the feed back bro,<br /><br />Kensai<br />
